{"layout":{"Umbraco.BlockList":[{"contentUdi":"umb://element/f29a8358387f4688a0c4400189cedbb2"},{"contentUdi":"umb://element/cb609fe21b1142b886a750a58b53d447"},{"contentUdi":"umb://element/ed52c2d658934e33bf0c7af5c5651599"}]},"contentData":[{"contentTypeKey":"338ac17e-85de-40c4-8028-34adf753b3c6","udi":"umb://element/f29a8358387f4688a0c4400189cedbb2","stringItemText":"Major Construction"},{"contentTypeKey":"338ac17e-85de-40c4-8028-34adf753b3c6","udi":"umb://element/cb609fe21b1142b886a750a58b53d447","stringItemText":"Soil Investigations"},{"contentTypeKey":"338ac17e-85de-40c4-8028-34adf753b3c6","udi":"umb://element/ed52c2d658934e33bf0c7af5c5651599","stringItemText":"Concrete Investigations"}],"settingsData":[]}
