    </expertiseList>
    <grid>
      <Value>
{"layout":{"Umbraco.BlockGrid":[{"contentUdi":"umb://element/4d13e6d7041f4f4ab0586b0f337a3198","areas":[],"columnSpan":12,"rowSpan":1}]},"contentData":[{"contentTypeKey":"9a4f7c2e-1b3d-4e8a-bf01-7d62a8f5c930","udi":"umb://element/4d13e6d7041f4f4ab0586b0f337a3198","content":"\u003cp\u003eBetween 2016 and 2019 Roadlab conducted all of the soils and concrete testing for the R2,8 billion Oiltanking MOGS Saldanha project in Langebaan, Western Cape.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e800 cubic meters of concrete was cast each day. It was Roadlab\u0027s responsibility to ensure the quality, workability and strength of all concrete sent to site while monitoring strict temperature controls on the batching temperature of the concrete.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eA joint venture between Oiltanking MOGS and Industrial Development Corporation of South Africa, the project took receipt of approximately 143,000 m3 (900,000 barrels) of crude oil on April 17, 2020.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"/media/wsip20rz/otms-1.jpg\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"/media/4hhi3opr/otms-5.jpg\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"/media/c3tprflr/otms-8.jpg\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"/media/dx4n5mlc/otms-11.jpg\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"/media/arihxp4x/otms-13.jpg\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"/media/dmwbgxff/otms-15.jpg\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"/media/agskmcdw/otms-17.jpg\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"/media/vonif1dy/otms-19.jpg\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"/media/t3hpzctv/otms-21.jpg\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"/media/42ubhjxz/otms-3.jpg\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"/media/naljkvk3/otms-6.jpg\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"/media/obbbafay/otms-9.jpg\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"/media/frcl3gc2/otms-12.jpg\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"/media/v5tbdje5/otms-14.jpg\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"/media/3pcmk3aq/otms-16.jpg\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"/media/fz0h2piv/otms-18.jpg\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"/media/bv4dl0b4/otms-20.jpg\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"/media/mmjapabc/otms-22.jpg\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan class=\"heading-h3 heading-h2\"\u003eWe\u0027re ready to work with you.\u003cbr /\u003eReach out to us below. \u003cbr /\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n"}],"settingsData":[]}
</Value>
    </grid>
    <heroContent>
      <Value><![CDATA[<p style="text-align: left;">Roadlab performed all soils and concrete testing on the R2,8 billion Oiltanking MOGS Saldanha (OTMS) project between 2016 and 2019.</p>
<p>We are ready to provide you with advice or a quote.<br /><strong>Send us an enquiry <a href="/head-office/#reachout" title="Head Office" data-anchor="#reachout">here</a></strong> or call <strong>060 727 8002.</strong></p>]]></Value>
    </heroContent>
